  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-feasibility Study of Green Shipping Corridors for the ASEAN Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objectives are:

1. Overview of ship traffic, energy use and CO2 emissions in the ASEAN region.
2. Identification of potential green shipping corridors in the Southeast Asia region.
3. Gather corridor-relevant data from ASEAN Member States.

The main activities will include:

1. AIS analysis of ship traffic, energy use and CO2 emissions for the ASEAN region. 
2. Identification and assessment of potential green shipping corridors in the ASEAN Region.
3. Evaluation of input data from ASEAN Member states.

This project will be the initial step towards establishing green shipping corridors, hence, if successfully implemented, will support realizing national, regional and international goals of reducing GHG emissions.</narrative>
  </description>
